# external-dns

## pihole webhook

```yaml
    provider:
      name: webhook # Using webhook due to Pihole v6 incompatibility
      webhook:
        env:
          - name: LOG_LEVEL
            value: *logLevel
          - name: PIHOLE_PASSWORD
            valueFrom:
              secretKeyRef:
                key: EXTERNAL_DNS_PIHOLE_PASSWORD
                name: *secret
          - name: PIHOLE_SERVER
            valueFrom:
              secretKeyRef:
                key: EXTERNAL_DNS_PIHOLE_SERVER
                name: *secret
          - name: PIHOLE_TLS_INSECURE
            valueFrom:
              secretKeyRef:
                key: EXTERNAL_DNS_PIHOLE_TLS_SKIP_VERIFY
                name: *secret
        image:
          repository: ghcr.io/tarantini-io/external-dns-pihole-webhook
          tag: v1.0.0
        livenessProbe:
          httpGet:
            path: /healthz
            port: http-webhook
          initialDelaySeconds: 10
          timeoutSeconds: 5
        readinessProbe:
          httpGet:
            path: /readyz
            port: http-webhook
          initialDelaySeconds: 10
          timeoutSeconds: 5
```
